onospace;font-size:12px\"><li style=\"margin-left:12px;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis;overflow:hidden;padding-top:2px;line-height:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(136,19,145)\">innerHTML</span><span>: </span><span title=\"HTML(&quot;&amp;lt;p class=&quot;bg-danger&quot;&amp;gt; FALSE &amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&quot;)\" style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22);white-space:pre\">&quot;HTML(&quot;&amp;lt;p class=&quot;bg-danger&quot;&amp;gt; FALSE &amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&quot;)&quot;</span></li><li style=\"margin-left:12px;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis;overflow:hidden;padding-top:2px;line-height:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(136,19,145)\">innerText</span><span>: </span><span title=\"HTML(&quot;&lt;p class=&quot;bg-danger&quot;&gt; FALSE &lt;/p&gt;&quot;)\" style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22);white-space:pre\">&quot;HTML(&quot;&lt;p class=&quot;bg-danger&quot;&gt; FALSE &lt;/p&gt;&quot;)&quot;</span></li></ol><div><font color=\"#c41a16\" face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:12px;white-space:pre\"><br></span></font></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#39;Source Sans Pro&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Any suggestions on how to get the css to take hold?</span><font color=\"#c41a16\" face=\"Consolas, Lucida Console, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:12px;white-space:pre\"><br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#39;Source Sans Pro&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-family:&#39;Source Sans Pro&#39;,&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Thanks, Stephen...</span></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
